This is an IntelliJ plugin to manage Ardor contract deployment.
Install This plugin from the IntelliJ settings plugins page.

To build the plugin:
1. Open the folder containing this readme file in IntelliJ as an IntelliJ project
2. To test, start the runIde gradle task
3. To build, start the buildPlugin task. The result is ContractManagerPlugin-<version>.zip in build/distributions.
